         <div xml:id="dictFrontPage_Cairo">
            <head>A Digital Dictionary of Cairo Arabic</head>
            
            <p>Compiled by <hi rend="italic">Karlheinz Mörth</hi>
          <lb/>In collaboration with <hi rend="italic">Tarek Eltayeb</hi></p>
            
            <p>This small dictionary was started as part of a course in Egyptian
    Arabic at the University of Vienna.</p>
            
            <p>To query the dictionary click <ref target="func:openDict_Cairo()">here</ref>.</p>
            <p>For details as to how to formulate meaningful dictionary queries consult the 
                <rs ref="text:dictFrontPage_Tunis">examples of the TUNICO dictionary</rs>.</p>
            
